// Copy to .devcontainer/devcontainer.json in a dataflow lab repo: VS Code then
// offers "Reopen in Container" with the course's image (see STUDENTS.md).
// The user (student), the Java extension and its settings, and the shared
// df-env-vscode-server volume come from the image's devcontainer.metadata
// label, so nothing else is needed here.
{
  "name": "Dataflow lab",
  "image": "ghcr.io/gtiit-cs-seminar/df-env:latest"
}
